## Varias figuras lado a lado

Con `layout-ncol` las subfiguras se acomodan en columnas (@fig-panel).

::: {#fig-panel .cell layout-ncol='2' execution_count=3}
``` {.python .cell-code}
rng = np.random.default_rng(42)

plt.figure(figsize=(4, 3))
plt.hist(rng.normal(size=1000), bins=30, color="tab:blue")
plt.show()

plt.figure(figsize=(4, 3))
plt.hist(rng.uniform(size=1000), bins=30, color="tab:orange")
plt.show()
```

